  "title": "NSIS: Create extcap\\README.txt",
  "description": "Invoking most of the binaries under the extcap directory on Windows requires additional environment setup which isn't necessarily obvious.\nThis commit updates the NSIS installer to place a simple `README.txt` in the `extcap` directory with a brief explanation of those requirements.\n\nThis is intended to be a minimally intrusive improvement to address Issue #17129.",
