      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 482366772,
          "type": null,
          "body": "As I noted on the Issue, this now creates a 3rd copy of this info to maintain after the Developers Guide and doc/extcap.pod, which is installed as extcap.html.\n\nMaybe, if others think extra documentation is required, a copy (or a move) of extcap.html from the main install directory to the plugins\\extcap directory would minimise the duplication and be more helpful.",
